//   A. due date before now − GRACE_PERIOD_HOURS and status not completed
//   B. status in progress and not modified for STALE_UPDATE_DAYS
// The due-soon window is not searched: those tasks never alert.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
